# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
## [version] - year-month-day
### Added
### Changed
### Deprecated
### Removed
### Fixed
### Security

##[2.0.0] - 2026-03-26
## Added
-Add Petsc solver
-Add new constant gradient boundary conditions
-Add new compressed output flag




##[1.0.0] - 2025-07-28
## Added
-Additional boundary conditions
-Parallelisation to the solver

## Changed
-mat.in variables


##[0.4.1] - 2024-12-03
### Added
-Periodic boundary conditions

### Changed
-Error handeling


## [0.4.0] - 2024-03-21
### Added

 - Added ability to specify the range of cells that are written to the output file.
 - Added ability to specifiy kappa boundary at 1x,1y,1z and nx,ny,nz 
 - Comments

### Changed

 - Changed the format of the system input geometry and heating, and merged them.

### Removed
 - Source parameter in mat.in 
### Fixed

 - General formatting

## [0.3.0] - 2024-03-05

### Added

 - Cattaneo
 - 'Volz' heating

### Fixed
 
 - General code tidy
